translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_2a5b184b:

#   mc "I bring news."
    mc "Traigo noticias."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:758
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_758a01bd:

#   z "Good or bad?"
    z "¿Bueno o malo?"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:760
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_47d36bec:

#   mc "Let me be clear. Both [gg] and [gb] came to me aiming for your favor. Why they thought I could change your mind is beyond me."
    mc "Que quede claro: tanto [gg] como [gb] acudieron a mí buscando tu favor. Por qué pensaron que yo podría hacerte cambiar de opinión es algo que se me escapa."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:762
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_0c5e6f36:

#   z "Did they? Hm. Tell me what you think."
    z "Díganme lo que piensan."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:764
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_42d25010:

#   mc "[gb], always the agreeable one. [gg] plays tough."
    mc "[gb], siempre el agradable. [gg] se hace el duro."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:765
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_35cd5358:

#   mc "But the situation is simple. Both girls want in."
    mc "Pero la situación es sencilla: las dos chicas quieren entrar."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:767
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_201bb40b:

#   mc "Without overstepping, what are our intentions regarding the girls?"
    mc "Sin excedernos, ¿cuáles son nuestras intenciones con respecto a las chicas?"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:769
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_52810675:

#   z "That's not how it works, son. You speak first."
    z "Así no funciona, hijo. Habla tú primero."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:771
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_9faaa756:

#   mc "[gb] is known for her loose... morals and questionable loyalty at best. The hostility from [cl] is a clear indicator of a coming trouble in the family."
    mc "[gb] es conocida por su floja... moral y cuestionable lealtad en el mejor de los casos. La hostilidad de [cl] es un claro indicador de que se avecinan problemas en la familia."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:772
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_4a447b22:

#   mc "However, her connections throughout the city offer insane potential."
    mc "Sin embargo, sus conexiones en toda la ciudad ofrecen un potencial demencial."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:774
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_23f89496:

#   mc "[gg]... You two go way back, right? She's always been sharp and on point... Respected and resourceful. Plus, she despises the app."
    mc "[gg]... Vosotros dos os conocéis desde hace mucho tiempo, ¿verdad? Siempre ha sido aguda y precisa... Respetada e ingeniosa. Además, desprecia la aplicación."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:775
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_8f5c3980:

#   mc "Speaking of..."
    mc "Hablando de..."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:777
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_3c46e48b:

#   mc "An individual linked to [hns] orchestrated an assault on you and [op] Steven. I didn't even know he was her father... Crazy."
    mc "Un individuo vinculado a [hns] orquestó una agresión contra ti y [op] Steven. Ni siquiera sabía que era su padre... Una locura."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:778
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_1e8acba1:

#   mc "So the lady in black..."
    mc "Así que la dama de negro..."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:780
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_eb66f998:

#   z "Who?"
    z "¿A quién?"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:782
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_0c4900b4:

#   mc "Someone among the top brass of [hns]"
    mc "Alguien entre los altos mandos de [hns]"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:783
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_3dd8457c:

#   mc "Anyway, she KNOWS who killed [op]."
    mc "De todos modos, ella SABE quién mató a [op]."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:785
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_0cabddd4:

#   z "How do you know this?"
    z "¿Cómo lo sabes?"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:786
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_323b797b:

#   mc "Eavesdropping at the right time."
    mc "Espiar en el momento oportuno."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:788
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_e047453b:

#   z "Trading vendetta for allegiance, they know how to get to [gg]."
    z "Cambiando venganza por lealtad, saben cómo llegar a [gg]."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:789
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_6a4ab934:

#   mc "[gg] declined their offer outright. She refused to be reduced to a mere courier. Her conversation with the lady in black put her in fucking rage mode."
    mc "[gg] Rechazó de plano su oferta. Se negó a que la redujeran a mera mensajera. Su conversación con la dama de negro la puso en modo de puta rabia."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:791
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_16cc8986:

#   z "Doesn't matter. Revenge is the only thing in [gg]'s mind. She'll confront them, with or without our team."
    z "No importa. La venganza es lo único que tiene en mente [gg]. Se enfrentará a ellos, con o sin nuestro equipo."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:792
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_79dba188:

#   mc "Shit..."
    mc "Mierda..."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:794
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_ca71baf0:

#   z "Not that simple, is it?"
    z "No es tan sencillo, ¿verdad?"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:795
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_e78228bc:

#   z "[gg]'s on a revenge mission, and [hns] has the answers."
    z "[gg] está en una misión de venganza, y [hns] tiene las respuestas."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:797
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_da74e5cf:

#   z "[gb] and her connections... Hah. Please."
    z "[gb] y sus conexiones... Hah. Por favor."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:798
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_9f9e45be:

#   z "Connections to what, exactly?"
    z "¿Conexiones con qué, exactamente?"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:800
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_f69ff834:

#   mc "Morph supplies?"
    mc "¿Suministros Morph?"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:802
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_99f34a42:

#   z "Clarify this for me. Was [gb] responsible for the Morph supplies we hijacked? No. We rely on strong and reliable intel inside [hns]. Your IT guy."
    z "Aclárame esto. ¿Fue [gb] responsable de los suministros Morph que secuestramos? No. Nos basamos en información sólida y fiable dentro de [hns]. Tu informático."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:804
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_b9d53697:

#   mc "Girl."
    mc "Chica."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:806
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_9a731181:

#   z "No opportunistic sluts involved. Just data."
    z "No hay putas oportunistas de por medio, sólo datos."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:808
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_6610c3ae:

#   mc "But... in the room with [r]..."
    mc "Pero... en la habitación con [r]..."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:810
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_835d6228:

#   z "Reverse psychology. Despite what she claims, [gb] is not the answer to our problems."
    z "Psicología inversa. A pesar de lo que ella afirma, [gb] no es la respuesta a nuestros problemas."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:811
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_62106f9d:

#   z "Angered [r] will now dig into [gb]. Additionally, we're clear on [gg]'s motives, too."
    z "Enfadado [r] , ahora indagará en [gb]. Además, también tenemos claros los motivos de [gg]."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:813
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_63fe265f:

#   z "From the looks of it, most of our data collection is complete."
    z "Por lo que parece, la mayor parte de nuestra recogida de datos está completa."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:814
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_6e8c6d8b:

#   mc "But still no solution."
    mc "Pero sigue sin haber solución."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:816
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_d94da604:

#   z "Seems like a no-brainer to me."
    z "A mí me parece una obviedad."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:818
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_d85a3ac5:

#   mc "Which is?"
    mc "¿Cuál es?"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:820
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_ca2ab136:

#   z "Kill them both."
    z "Mátalos a los dos."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:821
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_8d44e92e:

#   mc "Jesus... Umm..."
    mc "Jesús... Umm..."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:823
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_bb50c6e1:

#   z "Or you got something else up your sleeve?"
    z "¿O tienes algo más en la manga?"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:829
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_e471f09b:

#   mc "[gg]."
    mc "[gg]."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:830
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_895eb198:

#   mc "She had high hopes for your call till the very end. But as it didn't happen, she's already onto the next thing."
    mc "Tuvo grandes esperanzas en tu llamada hasta el final, pero como no se produjo, ya está en lo siguiente."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:832
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_34e5f712:

#   mc "I get that [cl] put an offer on the table, but let's be real, you're the only one with the final say in the family."
    mc "Entiendo que [cl] ponga una oferta sobre la mesa, pero seamos realistas, tú eres la única que tiene la última palabra en la familia."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:833
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_b18839e3:

#   mc "I'd say we go for [gg]. I've got her back in figuring out who did [op] in."
    mc "Yo diría que vayamos a por [gg]. Yo me encargo de averiguar quién hizo entrar a [op]."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:835
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_b35e0ab8:

#   z "If she finds the chemist, she is in. How about that?"
    z "Si encuentra al químico, está dentro. ¿Qué te parece?"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:836
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_c309aab1:

#   mc "I'll talk to her as soon as possible."
    mc "Hablaré con ella lo antes posible."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:838
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_c245dcee:

#   z "Very good."
    z "Muy buena."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:844
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_e892b2fe:

#   mc "We're kinda running dry on city contacts."
    mc "Nos estamos quedando sin contactos en la ciudad."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:845
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_6651e646:

#   mc "[gb] is nothing without the [z] family... If you decide she's worth the investment... Umm..."
    mc "[gb] no es nada sin la familia [z] ... Si decides que ella merece la inversión... Umm..."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:847
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_1f6352d5:

#   mc "Shit, I'm kinda tapped out trying to defend [gb]."
    mc "Mierda, estoy un poco agotado intentando defender a [gb]."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:849
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_2ce956aa:

#   z "No [gb], then."
    z "No [gb], entonces."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:851
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_2c52c74e:

#   mc "I've got an idea: I'll sit down with [gb] and arrange one last test. She brings us that chemist, and she's part of the family."
    mc "Tengo una idea: me sentaré con [gb] y organizaré una última prueba. Ella nos trae a ese químico, y forma parte de la familia."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:853
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_a8ea4480:

#   z "I'm a bit skeptical, but it wouldn't hurt to challenge her and find out her true strengths."
    z "Soy un poco escéptico, pero no estaría de más desafiarla y descubrir sus verdaderos puntos fuertes."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:855
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_ee3360a2:

#   z "Do it."
    z "Hazlo."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:859
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_99930e00:

#   mc "I've been hearing whispers about [gb] and [cl]. What's the real deal?"
    mc "He estado oyendo rumores sobre [gb] y [cl] ¿Cuál es el verdadero asunto?"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:861
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_36cfc613:

#   z "Only whispers? Ugh. Don't even get me started..."
    z "¿Sólo susurros? No me hagas empezar..."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:862
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_f1ca8741:

#   z "What else could it be? Love, obviously!"
    z "¿Qué otra cosa podría ser? ¡El amor, obviamente!"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:864
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_0365791c:

#   z "Even worse. Old flames."
    z "Peor aún, viejas llamas."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:865
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_4a8d8f48:

#   mc "Ew... Like between the two of them?"
    mc "Ew... ¿Como entre ellos dos?"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:867
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_0a13c474:

#   z "God, no! Just when one's ready to say 'I do', her sister steps in and changes everything."
    z "Dios, no! Justo cuando una está preparada para decir \"sí, quiero\", su hermana interviene y lo cambia todo."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:868
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_8803740d:

#   z "If you want details, ask both of them."
    z "Si quieres detalles, pregunta a ambos."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:870
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_9f5477e9:

#   mc "Why both?"
    mc "¿Por qué ambos?"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:872
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_e0fbfe60:

#   z "They've got their own differing versions."
    z "Tienen sus propias versiones diferentes."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:874
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_d1ba1345:

#   z "Between you and me, my hands are already full with... women troubles. I've got no room for more."
    z "Entre tú y yo, ya tengo las manos llenas con... problemas de mujeres. No tengo sitio para más."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:876
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_5150dd08:

#   mc "Anything I can do to help?"
    mc "¿Puedo ayudar en algo?"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:878
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_8315d835:

#   z "No need. I've got some other eyes on this."
    z "No hace falta, tengo otros ojos puestos en esto."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:879
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_59d1cadc:

#   mc "If I'm needed..."
    mc "Si me necesitan..."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:881
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_07e01d61:

#   z "I'll let you know."
    z "Te lo haré saber."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:900
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_9b205823:

#   z "[r]'s mentioned your kill count. Impressive."
    z "[r] ha mencionado tu recuento de asesinatos. Impresionante."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:902
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_aeef2f7d:

#   mc "The streets needed a reminder: becoming a Slayer is a death wish."
    mc "Las calles necesitaban un recordatorio: convertirse en Cazadora es un deseo de muerte."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:903
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_19d61cf1:

#   mc "And we showed these idiots we mean business."
    mc "Y demostramos a esos idiotas que vamos en serio."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:905
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_909a2ad5:

#   z "Risking it all like that? Not the brightest, but you've got guts, I'll give you that."
    z "¿Arriesgarlo todo así? No es lo más brillante, pero tienes agallas, lo reconozco."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:906
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_02d88f6e:

#   z "Don't do it again."
    z "No vuelvas a hacerlo."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:908
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_1488a15d:

#   mc "Oh, so it was all for nothing?"
    mc "¿Así que todo fue en vano?"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:910
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_8f1f6ae1:

#   z "I wouldn't put it like that."
    z "Yo no lo diría así."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:916
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_d86a6a7a:

#   "Current Zhine debt: [zp.debt]."
    "Deuda actual de Zhine: [zp.debt]."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:918
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_032aef2d:

#   z "How about that?"
    z "¿Qué te parece?"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:919
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_bd7e3966:

#   mc "This is peak happiness for me. The thought of 'never doing that again'... now that's a real challenge, isn't it?"
    mc "Esto es para mí la felicidad máxima. Pensar en \"no volver a hacer eso nunca más\"... eso sí que es un verdadero reto, ¿no?"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:921
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_f07f82e2:

#   z "I couldn't agree with you more."
    z "No podría estar más de acuerdo contigo."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:926
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_z_menu_b924d3d0:

#   mct "I still have the Cleo and Gabby drama to deal with."
    mct "Todavía tengo que lidiar con el drama de Cleo y Gabby."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:947
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_mi_cba31778:

#   mc "Why so grumpy?"
    mc "¿Por qué tan gruñón?"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:949
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_mi_567397b3:

#   mi "A pleasant event with the elite at a fancy place, as I was told. And yet, here I am..."
    mi "Un evento agradable con la élite en un lugar elegante, según me dijeron. Y sin embargo, aquí estoy..."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:950
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_mi_d238dce4:

#   mi "Hanging out in a bar with criminals celebrating mass murder."
    mi "Pasar el rato en un bar con delincuentes que celebran asesinatos en masa."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:952
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_mi_5792b6f1:

#   mc "Well, if that's what's up, then chatting with me might not be top of your list, huh?"
    mc "Bueno, si eso es lo que pasa, puede que chatear conmigo no sea lo primero en tu lista, ¿eh?"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:954
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_mi_65ae4350:

#   mi "You're not even involved in this."
    mi "Ni siquiera estás implicado en esto."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:955
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_mi_ee5fabbb:

#   mc "On the contrary."
    mc "Al contrario."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:957
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_mi_b8cea5e3:

#   mi "You did this?"
    mi "¿Has hecho esto?"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:959
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_mi_b3d641d3:

#   mc "Not by myself."
    mc "No por mí misma."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:961
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_mi_d8fd810e:

#   mi "As if my night wasn't bad enough."
    mi "Como si mi noche no hubiera sido suficientemente mala."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:963
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_mi_ce5f2abf:

#   mi "Instead, I'll be on pins and needles, waiting for that hospital call to treat a whole parade of injuries."
    mi "En cambio, estaré en ascuas, esperando esa llamada del hospital para tratar todo un desfile de lesiones."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:965
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_mi_7d48cdf3:

#   mc "All clear on this end. Not a single... treatable injury to report."
    mc "Todo despejado por este lado. Ni una sola lesión tratable de la que informar."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:967
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_mi_1d0bf520:

#   mi "Huh?"
    mi "¿Eh?"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:968
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_mi_b95119b2:

#   mi "Oh, wonderful! You're gloating about killing them all? Feeling good about yourself now, are you?"
    mi "¡Maravilloso! ¿Te regodeas de haberlos matado a todos? ¿Ahora te sientes bien contigo mismo?"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:970
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_mi_ddb14173:

#   mc "Fuck yeah! 3 vs 10! Not counting the random ramming by a crazy trucker in the middle of the city."
    mc "¡Claro que sí! ¡3 contra 10! Sin contar la embestida aleatoria de un camionero loco en medio de la ciudad."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:971
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_mi_b564e081:

#   mc "Lives saved, stash saved... A full blown success!"
    mc "Vidas salvadas, alijo salvado... ¡Un éxito en toda regla!"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:973
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_mi_96661feb:

#   mi "Good for you."
    mi "Me alegro por ti."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:975
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_mi_296b71c5:

#   mc "What's with the attitude, [mi]?"
    mc "¿A qué viene esa actitud, [mi]?"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:977
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_mi_bee4cc50:

#   mi "What attitude?"
    mi "¿Qué actitud?"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:979
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_mi_ad378c13:

#   mc "You can't expect to be involved with the mafia and not see dead bodies in the process. That's not how any of this works."
    mc "No puedes esperar involucrarte con la mafia y no ver cadáveres en el proceso. Así no funciona nada de esto."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:981
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_mi_46aa188d:

#   mi "What if I can turn things around?"
    mi "¿Y si puedo cambiar las cosas?"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:983
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_mi_906cf060:

#   mc "In what way? If [z] resigns and lets [hns] run wild, consider us finished. You included."
    mc "¿En qué sentido? Si [z] dimite y deja a [hns] campar a sus anchas, considéranos acabados. Tú incluido."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:984
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_mi_0fd77cdc:

#   mc "You know, all the craziness out there? That wasn't us. We're just responding to it, holding our own the best we can."
    mc "Ya sabes, toda la locura que hay ahí fuera... No fuimos nosotros. Sólo estamos respondiendo a ella, aguantando lo mejor que podemos."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:986
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_mi_67d29325:

#   mi "So we either fight back or run?"
    mi "¿Así que o nos defendemos o huimos?"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:988
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_mi_71241bd6:

#   mc "We finally scored a win after weeks... dealing heavy damage to [hns]'s crew and reputation."
    mc "Por fin conseguimos una victoria después de semanas... causando graves daños a la tripulación y a la reputación de [hns]."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:990
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_mi_523b0b8a:

#   mc "No fucking way we run!"
    mc "¡Ni de coña corremos!"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:992
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_mi_abc7b86c:

#   mi "I'd still choose running."
    mi "Seguiría eligiendo correr."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:993
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_mi_4c394137:

#   mc "Why don't you run, then?"
    mc "¿Por qué no huyes, entonces?"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:995
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_mi_d4729ce5:

#   mi "Cause I can't."
    mi "Porque no puedo."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:996
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_mi_23c98a61:

#   mct "Not being in a mood is [mi]'s default state..."
    mct "No estar de humor es el estado por defecto de [mi]..."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:998
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_mi_8af47fd8:

#   mi "I'm not in the mood..."
    mi "No estoy de humor..."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1000
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_mi_e62c9c6b:

#   mct "Go figure."
    mct "Imagínate."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1001
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_mi_f6a2dea6:

#   mct "What the hell is up with her? She's like a completely different person compared to when she was teasing [lil] at the restaurant to now."
    mct "¿Qué demonios le pasa? Es como una persona completamente diferente comparada de cuando se burlaba de [lil] en el restaurante a ahora."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1003
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_mi_d0acee37:

#   mi "Go celebrate."
    mi "Ve a celebrarlo."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1004
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_mi_0b8aa82a:

#   mc "Oh, I'm going to."
    mc "Oh, voy a hacerlo."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1006
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_mi_d7e65bbf:

#   mct "Who is she mad at? [lil]? Probably."
    mct "¿Con quién está enfadada? [lil] Probablemente."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1008
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting1_mi_110b1e08:

#   mct "Well, she's got her phone, so that's a start. Fingers crossed that chat gave [v] enough time to grab all the data."
    mct "Bueno, tiene su teléfono, así que por algo se empieza. Cruza los dedos para que ese chat haya dado [v] tiempo suficiente para recoger todos los datos."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1023
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_4ca04764:

#   cl "So?! How was it?!"
    cl "¿Y? ¿Cómo fue?"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1025
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_43f57646:

#   mc "How was what?"
    mc "¿Cómo era qué?"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1026
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_6404f0ce:

#   cl "The heist!"
    cl "¡El atraco!"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1028
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_fc7fd3fe:

#   cl "Tell me about the weapons! Were you using automatics? That sounds insanely cool!"
    cl "¡Háblame de las armas! ¿Utilizabas automáticas? ¡Eso suena increíblemente bien!"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1029
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_6cbcbdad:

#   mc "Yup. And a sniper rifle."
    mc "Sí, y un rifle de francotirador."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1031
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_aa498f6f:

#   cl "Holy shit! Can I use it?!"
    cl "Joder, ¿puedo usarlo?"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1032
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_5a9dd91b:

#   mc "I can't see why not?"
    mc "No veo por qué no."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1034
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_d1ed4a04:

#   cl "I've been practicing like crazy! I've actually gotten good at this! Not stopped shooting down choppers, and now, the bullets land in the same zip code!"
    cl "He estado practicando como un loco! ¡Realmente me he vuelto bueno en esto! No he parado de derribar helicópteros, y ahora, ¡las balas aterrizan en el mismo código postal!"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1035
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_0891e249:

#   cl "Still far from the target, but I'm getting there!"
    cl "Aún estoy lejos del objetivo, ¡pero lo estoy consiguiendo!"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1037
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_b93be8d4:

#   mc "How about we meet up again sometime? I'd love to see you in action with those guns!"
    mc "¿Qué tal si quedamos alguna vez? ¡Me encantaría verte en acción con esas armas!"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1039
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_273d9c96:

#   cl "Huh? And also see me shoot stuff? Come on, [mc]! You can do better than that!"
    cl "¿Eh? ¿Y también verme disparar cosas? ¡Vamos, [mc]! ¡Puedes hacerlo mejor!"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1041
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_b1901105:

#   cl "Can we do it in the open field this time?"
    cl "¿Podemos hacerlo esta vez en campo abierto?"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1042
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_42c3abdc:

#   cl "Wait... No!"
    cl "Espera... ¡No!"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1044
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_ca859dca:

#   mc "I'm fine wherever, baby!"
    mc "¡Estoy bien donde sea, nena!"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1046
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_aec4f573:

#   cl "Haha! You're such an idiot!"
    cl "Jaja, ¡qué idiota eres!"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1047
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_0837ec83:

#   cl "I'm thinking of going big this time... like, trying out some larger weapons."
    cl "Estoy pensando en ir a lo grande esta vez... por ejemplo, probar armas más grandes."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1049
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_fd72d38f:

#   mc "... Oh. Mine's not enough anymore?!"
    mc "... Oh. ¡¿La mía ya no es suficiente?!"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1051
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_22583fd4:

#   cl "I mean, guns! Automatics! Ughhhhhhh! I can't win, can I?!"
    cl "Quiero decir, ¡pistolas! ¡Automáticas! ¡Ughhhhhhh! No puedo ganar, ¿verdad?"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1053
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_907fb8f3:

#   mc "It's great to see you more confident. Just remember, with [hns] maybe eyeing us, we need to be ready but cautious too, okay?"
    mc "Es estupendo verte más seguro de ti mismo. Sólo recuerda que, con [hns] quizá mirándonos, tenemos que estar preparados pero también ser cautelosos, ¿vale?"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1055
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_d5a66ff4:

#   cl "Yes, sir!"
    cl "¡Sí, señor!"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1057
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_90826ee4:

#   cl "Hm. Everything alright?"
    cl "¿Todo bien?"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1058
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_c264e70d:

#   mc "I've dug up some insane info on [gb] and... I'm here to share."
    mc "He desenterrado información demencial sobre [gb] y... estoy aquí para compartirla."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1060
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_cba444bc:

#   cl "Ok...? But?"
    cl "¿Vale? ¿Pero?"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1061
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_2138c968:

#   mc "Can you clue me in on what went down between you gals?"
    mc "¿Puedes decirme qué pasó entre vosotras?"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1063
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_655e31bd:

#   cl "You really need to know? I fucking hate revisiting that shit."
    cl "¿Realmente necesitas saberlo? Odio volver sobre esa mierda."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1064
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_73631f45:

#   mc "Oh, ok. Nevermind, then."
    mc "Ah, vale. Entonces no importa."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1066
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_bf0ec513:

#   cl "Look at the slut."
    cl "Mira a la zorra."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1067
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_9a064d4b:

#   mc "I'm lookin'."
    mc "Estoy mirando."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1069
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_d6a9bbda:

#   cl "What do you see?"
    cl "¿Qué ves?"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1070
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_71e466f4:

#   mc "A slut?"
    mc "¿Una zorra?"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1072
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_43be84cf:

#   cl "But that's barely scratching the surface. She's the epitome of petty, a real vindictive piece of shit. Step on her toes, and she'll make sure your life turns to hell."
    cl "Pero eso es apenas arañar la superficie. Es la personificación de la mezquindad, una auténtica mierda vengativa. Písale los talones y se asegurará de que tu vida se convierta en un infierno."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1074
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_01e6c8bc:

#   cl "She hasn't stopped meddling and sabotaging my life for over twenty years!"
    cl "¡No ha dejado de entrometerse y sabotear mi vida desde hace más de veinte años!"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1076
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_3f32c931:

#   mc "Did you... do something to make her this mad?"
    mc "¿Hiciste... algo para que se enfadara tanto?"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1078
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_ce0628d0:

#   cl "Oh, why am I the target? Must be because I had the audacity to be born."
    cl "¿Por qué soy el objetivo? Debe ser porque tuve la osadía de nacer."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1079
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_8f7f3cb1:

#   mc "You hate her just as much."
    mc "La odias igualmente."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1081
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_fff0dd34:

#   cl "Not without a reason."
    cl "No sin motivo."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1082
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_d85a3ac5:

#   mc "Which is?"
    mc "¿Cuál es?"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1084
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_bde5e645:

#   cl "Young and stupid [cl] in love. The day I was supposed to be married."
    cl "Joven y estúpido [cl] enamorado</b0>. El día en que debía casarme."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1085
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_22b7dba9:

#   cl "[gb] walked in, all chatty, radiating happiness, and kissed my cheek. It was so out of character for [gb], but it felt sincere."
    cl "[gb] entró, todo charlatán, irradiando felicidad, y me besó en la mejilla. No era propio de [gb], pero lo sentí sincero."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1087
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_4092b023:

#   mc "Has she ever done that?"
    mc "¿Lo ha hecho alguna vez?"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1089
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_8a8c2df0:

#   cl "What? Kissed my cheek? A couple of times. Why?"
    cl "¿Qué? ¿Me ha besado la mejilla? Un par de veces. ¿Por qué?"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1090
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_74eed5a8:

#   mc "Just asking. Continue, please."
    mc "Sólo preguntaba. Continúa, por favor."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1092
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_ef485fb3:

#   gb "My dear sister, you look incredible!"
    gb "Mi querida hermana, ¡estás increíble!"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1093
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_6741fcb3:

#   gb "I'm speechless!"
    gb "¡Me he quedado sin palabras!"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1095
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_ed89a780:

#   cl "Awww! [gb]!"
    cl "Awww! [gb]!"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1097
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_9487ebc0:

#   cl "So I embraced her, but something felt wrong."
    cl "Así que la abracé, pero algo iba mal."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1098
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_846fbc72:

#   cl "Like, I don't know, her scent, the feeling of her all hot and out of breath."
    cl "Como, no sé, su olor, la sensación de estar toda caliente y sin aliento."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1100
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_e5916ff9:

#   cl "Ughhh! How could I have been so stupid?! It was a setup, and I fell for it."
    cl "¿Cómo he podido ser tan estúpida? Era una trampa y caí en ella."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1101
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_e47dbda3:

#   cl "I genuinely believed my sister was happy for me."
    cl "Creía sinceramente que mi hermana se alegraba por mí."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1103
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_275383fe:

#   cl "Then, later, there she was 'with' my fiancé, her gaze piercing me with pure hatred. I just stood there, frozen."
    cl "Luego, más tarde, allí estaba \"con\" mi prometido, con su mirada atravesándome de puro odio. Me quedé allí, congelada."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1105
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_ca7f7db2:

#   mc "Please tell me you marched in and kicked their asses."
    mc "Por favor, dime que entraste y les diste una patada en el culo."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1107
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_5e77c0c0:

#   cl "..."
    cl "..."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1108
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_585efa10:

#   cl "I ran."
    cl "Corrí."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1110
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_bfeac31f:

#   cl "... only to come back the same day. He had no idea he'd been caught. I stood there, waiting to hear his lies."
    cl "... sólo para volver el mismo día. No tenía ni idea de que le habían pillado. Me quedé allí, esperando a oír sus mentiras."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1111
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_cb9922d0:

#   cl "And he didn't disappoint. He acted as if nothing had ever happened, like our love meant fucking nothing."
    cl "Y no me decepcionó. Actuó como si nunca hubiera pasado nada, como si nuestro amor no significara nada, joder."

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1113
translate HZIlle ep4_glass_sitting2_cl_f729dd50:

#   mc "Wait a minute... Are you seriously telling me this wasn't the only time? That there'd been more?"
    mc "Espera un momento... ¿En serio me estás diciendo que ésta no ha sido la única vez? ¿Que ha habido más?"

# game/episodes/Ep4_2/episode4_2.rpy:1115
